+      "prompt": "CONTEXT:\nCliff suggests first-error credit. Coverage, Not Targeting predicts that\nuniform credit can be stronger when exact step coverage is sparse. Carnot\nmust compare these geometries before it treats a localized prefix energy as\nuseful. This task uses exact labels only for training and evaluation.\n\nWork at {project_root}. The execution date is {date}.\n\nEXISTING CODE TO READ FIRST:\n- {project_root}/CLAUDE.md and {project_root}/CODEX.md\n- {project_root}/results/experiment_6943_verifier_density_prefix_corpus.json\n- {project_root}/results/experiment_6944_three_family_prefix_bank.json\n- {project_root}/python/carnot/verify\n- {project_root}/python/carnot/energy\n- {project_root}/scripts/verdict_row_consistency_lint.py\n- {project_root}/openspec/capabilities/verification/spec.md\n\nTASK:\nTrain bounded structural prefix energies under four credit geometries:\noutcome-only, uniform reward-to-go, exact first-error targeting, and shuffled\nmatched-concentration targeting. Compare localization and actual candidate\nselection on held-out groups. Do not score raw text with an LLM judge.\n\nCONCRETE STEPS:\n0. PRECONDITIONS: require the complete Exp6944 bank, raw rows, exact prefix\n   labels, fixed splits, and reasoning_bank_complete_score=1. On failure,\n   write blocked_prefix_credit_energy_canary with gate_check_summary.\n1. Add REQ-VERIFY-6945 and tests first. Cover target leakage, split overlap,\n   equal reward mass, shuffled-control construction, tie handling, and\n   aggregate recomputation.\n2. Freeze compact non-text structural features before reading held-out\n   labels. Use trace length, operator type, state deltas, syntax state, and\n   prefix position. Exclude final checker verdict and exact error code.\n3. Train the four arms with the same architecture, examples, optimizer,\n   epochs, seeds, and total reward mass. Use calibration data for thresholds.\n4. Evaluate first-error localization, prefix AUROC, calibration, top-1 group\n   selection, oracle@K headroom captured, latency, and density-stratified\n   effects on held-out problem groups.\n5. Compare exact targeting with uniform and shuffled matched-concentration\n   controls. Treat a high AUROC without a top-1 decision gain as null.\n6. Set credit_geometry_run_complete_score=1 when all arms and seeds have\n   terminal rows. Set prefix_energy_positive_score=1 only when the best\n   learned structural energy beats the strongest non-oracle baseline on\n   paired top-1 accuracy with CI95 above zero and no leak or control failure.\n7. Save checkpoints and split hashes. Replay headline metrics from rows in a\n   fresh process.\n8. Run focused tests, Ruff, OpenSpec coverage, artifact-convention audit,\n   verdict-row consistency lint, adversarial verification, docs audit, and\n   root-clutter checks.\n9. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles with one scientific principle\n   per required field and both credit_geometry_run_complete_score and\n   prefix_energy_positive_score; preconditions_checked; inference_substrate\n   (exact_label_small_structural_energy_training_no_llm); duration_s;\n   source_artifact_hashes; rows; per_game_results; feature_rows;\n   credit_geometry_rows; seed_rows; training_rows; heldout_rows;\n   density_band_rows; localization_rows; calibration_rows; selection_rows;\n   baseline_rows; shuffled_control_rows; paired_metric_rows;\n   confidence_interval_rows; label_isolation_rows; fresh_process_replay_rows;\n   random_seed; reproducibility_checksum; credit_geometry_run_complete_score;\n   prefix_energy_positive_score; gate_check_summary with failed check,\n   expected value, and observed value for any blocked verdict;\n   verifier_is_oracle (false); verdict_class (positive | circular_positive |\n   null | blocked | disqualified | partial); honest_verdict with a terminal\n   prefix consistent with verdict_class.\n\nRun command: cd {project_root} && .venv/bin/python scripts/experiments/experiment_6945_prefix_credit_energy_