ict, verdict_class,\n   gate fields, and adversarial verification. Do not trust conductor OK\n   alone. Keep missing artifacts explicit.\n4. Recompute every available comparative headline from per-unit rows. Check\n   confidence intervals, strongest baselines, random-direction controls,\n   shuffled controls, model coverage, and label isolation.\n5. Report prefix_energy_positive_score, causal_hidden_state_positive_score,\n   branch_energy_positive_score, trace_state_positive_score, and\n   audited_trace_state_positive_score only from their authoritative\n   artifacts. Do not synthesize a positive score from partial evidence.\n6. Verify that ARC artifacts made no new solve claim and did not change the\n   solve registry. Verify continuous_self_learning_task=true,\n   learning_tier=2, delayed exact writes, and unchanged model hashes.\n7. Record exclusion-manifest candidates only where the same prior verdict\n   recurred under retire_if_same_verdict=true. Do not edit the manifest in\n   this task.\n8. Produce a three-gap V609 handoff from evidence that actually ran. Keep\n   unavailable hardware and external product claims outside the result.\n9. Set v608_capstone_complete_score=1 when every roadmap task has a terminal\n   classification row and the contract audit completes. Use verdict_class\n   partial when evidence is incomplete, with a matching partial_ verdict\n   prefix.\n10. Run focused tests, Ruff, OpenSpec coverage, artifact-convention audit,\n    verdict-row consistency lint, adversarial verification, docs audit, and\n    root-clutter checks.\n11. REQUIRED ARTIFACT FIELDS: field_principles with one scientific\n    principle per required field and v608_capstone_complete_score;\n    preconditions_checked; inference_substrate\n    (independent_artifact_replay_and_contract_reconciliation_no_llm);\n    duration_s; source_artifact_hashes; rows; task_contract_rows;\n    task_state_rows; gate_replay_rows; verdict_class_rows;\n    adversarial_verify_rows; aggregate_re